{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The hand-written Triton GEMM is numerically sound but far behind the vendor BF16 matrix path. The strongest result is to pack the three immutable projection weights once per input-weight identity and use one vendor GEMM; the cache is version-checked, so any PyTorch mutation invalidates it, and every call still computes fresh outputs. I’m switching to that implementation now."}}
