{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_62","type":"agent_message","text":"The specialized kernel is worthwhile only in the 257–512 token band: it avoids the weight copy and runs about 3–5 μs faster there, while vendor GEMM remains decisively better elsewhere. I’m integrating that narrow, semantics-general hybrid and retaining the verified torch paths for all other sizes."}}
